  "title": "Legacy project understanding keeps old ASP.NET route table context focused",
  "description": "Runs the real scanner against a small old ASP.NET MVC/Web API route-table fixture, then verifies ContextPack selects the billing route table and handler graph without leaking an unrelated customer route.",
